OL,3,GNEWSAThames Valley devolution plans put
OL,4,Ato government
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeaders in the Thames Valley have
OL,7,Fagreed on a plan for local devolution,
OL,8,Fwhich they say could bring "billions of
OL,9,Fpounds of investment" to the region.
OL,11,FAuthorities in Oxfordshire, Berkshire
OL,12,Fand Swindon submitted their proposals
OL,13,Fon Monday, the day of the government's
OL,14,Fdeadline for the plans.
OL,16,FThey are calling for a devolution deal
OL,17,Fand secure funding for a new authority
OL,18,Fcovering the Thames Valley ahead of
OL,19,FChancellor John Healey's budget on
OL,20,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
