OL,3,GNEWSAThames Valley devolution plans put
OL,4,Ato government
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe councils have spent the last two
OL,7,Fyears drawing up the plans, which would
OL,8,Fcreate a new regional authority with
OL,9,Fsimilar powers to those of the mayors
OL,10,Fof Greater Manchester and London.
